  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AW-READY-O5/aw1-o3> ;
  triage:triageRecordVersion "1" .

# quality-mgr, 2026-09-05, qa-pr1212-r2: RetainedEvent.level is now the
# ATM-owned RetainedLevel facade enum (tracing_bridge.rs:70-104), no raw
# sc_observability_types::Level on any public field; RULE-001
# (.claude/agents/arch-qa.md:59-67) updated to name atm-observability as
# current owner plus atm/src/main.rs as the sole binary-entry-point exception.
# atm-graft-python's GraftFallbackLogger now routes through the shared
# atm_observability::sanitize_retained_fields instead of a duplicated filter.
# Workspace-wide grep swept by arch-qa/ruthless-boundary-qa/quality-mgr found
# no other raw-type leak. Independently confirmed on fix/aw-readiness-arch at
# 8af276eb3.

